      "text": "The limited liquidity of the pool, which resulted in the manipulation of the price oracle. Vulnerable code snippet: Attack tx: https://phalcon.blocksec.com/tx/eth/0x927b784148b60d5233e57287671cdf67d38e3e69e5b6d0ecacc7c1aeaa98985b… Analysis: https://x.com/BlockSecTeam/status/1613267000913960976"
